---
import { app, data, repoUrl, releasesUrl } from '../lib/site';
import Logo from './Logo.astro';
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="footer">
  <div class="container foot-inner">
    <div class="foot-brand">
      <div class="fb-row"><Logo size={28} /><strong>{app.name}</strong></div>
      <p>Windows 本地离线多媒体与文档处理工具箱。<br />{data.stats.features} 个功能 · {data.stats.nodes} 个工作流节点 · 文件永不上传。</p>
      <div class="foot-pledge">🔒 零遥测 · 零上传 · 零广告</div>
    </div>
    <div class="foot-cols">
      <div>
        <h4>产品</h4>
        <a href="#features">核心亮点</a>
        <a href="#why-local">对比优势</a>
        <a href="#workflow">节点工作流</a>
        <a href="#compare">效果实测</a>
        <a href="#all-features">功能清单</a>
        <a href="#download">免费下载</a>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h4>开源</h4>
        <a href={repoUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub 仓库</a>
        <a href={releasesUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener">更新日志</a>
        <a href={`${repoUrl}/issues`} target="_blank" rel="noopener">问题反馈</a>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h4>技术栈</h4>
        <span>Electron {app.electron.split('.')[0]}</span>
        <span>FFmpeg {app.ffmpeg}</span>
        <span>Resvg · SVGO</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="container foot-bottom">
    <span>© {year} {app.name} · 基于 {app.license} 协议开源</span>
    <span>FFmpeg 是 FFmpeg 项目的商标，本软件内置的二进制文件来自 gyan.dev 构建。</span>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .footer { border-top: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 56px 0 76px; margin-top: 40px; background: var(--bg-elev); }
  .foot-inner { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 48px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .fb-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-size: 16px; }
  .foot-brand p { margin-top: 14px; color: var(--text-3); font-size: 14px; max-width: 360px; }
  .foot-pledge {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;
    margin-top: 16px; padding: 5px 12px; border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 12px; color: #b9f5d6;
    background: rgba(61, 214, 140, .09); border: 1px solid rgba(61, 214, 140, .25);
  }
  .foot-cols { display: flex; gap: 64px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .foot-cols div { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; font-size: 14px; }
  .foot-cols h4 { font-size: 13px; color: var(--text); margin-bottom: 4px; font-weight: 600; }
  .foot-cols a, .foot-cols span { color: var(--text-3); }
  .foot-cols a:hover { color: var(--text); }
  .foot-bottom {
    margin-top: 44px; padding-top: 22px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;
    font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-3);
  }
</style>
